<td id="S3.T1.3.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">HPSv2Score <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">31</a>]</cite></td>
